    "name": "Heidi's Legacy: Mountains Calling",
    "steam_appid": 3589430,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3589430/extras/939263a370fea1e43d7afd1844336dfd.webp?t=1749817882\" width=600 height=40 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as Ad\u00e8le, a young woman who escapes harsh city life to find peace in the mountains. Taken in by a grumpy but kind old man, you're entrusted with caring for his goats and gradually become part of a small alpine village, where life moves gently but meaningfully.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3589430/extras/7439b88e6034cc3f00bf852d9d508583.webp?t=1749817882\" width=350 height=30 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3589430/extras/3fe73b3c07298706e63509d130bddead.poster.avif?t=1749817882\" width=600 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3589430/extras/3fe73b3c07298706e63509d130bddead.webm?t=1749817882\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3589430/extras/3fe73b3c07298706e63509d130bddead.mp4?t=1749817882\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Guide your goats through blooming meadows, help them find the best flowers to graze, and keep them happy with toys and attention. In return, they'll provide milk and wool, which are precious resources for the village's revival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3589430/extras/c0ebf2b0eb40fceeede644244d03cd0c.webp?t=1749817882\" width=350 height=30 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3589430/extras/8e19e36b1d1d0ff7409f5c099e26f3b4.poster.avif?t=1749817882\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3589430/extras/8e19e36b1d1d0ff7409f5c099e26f3b4.webm?t=1749817882\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3589430/extras/8e19e36b1d1d0ff7409f5c099e26f3b4.mp4?t=1749817882\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use what nature provides to create artisanal products like cheese, wool clothing, herbal remedies, and wooden crafts. Trade or share these with villagers to help improve their homes and livelihoods. Every choice helps shape your relationship with the community.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3589430/extras/2448db867dbc2e4a0f05d3fb9fa14c48.webp?t=1749817882\" width=350 height=30 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3589430/extras/148ab698b866eef222ad8e739cad1c1b.poster.avif?t=1749817882\" width=600 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3589430/extras/148ab698b866eef222ad8e739cad1c1b.webm?t=1749817882\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3589430/extras/148ab698b866eef222ad8e739cad1c1b.mp4?t=1749817882\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wander across lush valleys, quiet forests, and high-altitude lakes. Herd goats, forage for herbs and mushrooms, and fish in peaceful alpine waters. As you aid the village, you'll unlock new abilities that make it easier to climb, leap, and uncover parts of your newfound world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3589430/extras/648e1c3c26938eb5bde0a7e34480c4c6.webp?t=1749817882\" width=350 height=30 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3589430/extras/187369e099987014a2cae5bcbfd1d74c.poster.avif?t=1749817882\" width=600 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3589430/extras/187369e099987014a2cae5bcbfd1d74c.webm?t=1749817882\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3589430/extras/187369e099987014a2cae5bcbfd1d74c.mp4?t=1749817882\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Through branching dialogue and personal choices, you'll support villagers in rebuilding not just their homes but their lives. Will you embrace slow living or push for bolder change? Stay cozy within the village or open up to what lies beyond?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by the spirit of the<i> Heidi </i>novels, the narrative explores themes of healing through nature, the importance of helping one another, and the different ways to rebuild a community.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3589430/extras/939263a370fea1e43d7afd1844336dfd.webp?t=1749817882\" width=600 height=40 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as Ad\u00e8le, a young woman who escapes harsh city life to find peace in the mountains. Taken in by a grumpy but kind old man, you're entrusted with caring for his goats and gradually become part of a small alpine village, where life moves gently but meaningfully.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3589430/extras/7439b88e6034cc3f00bf852d9d508583.webp?t=1749817882\" width=350 height=30 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3589430/extras/3fe73b3c07298706e63509d130bddead.poster.avif?t=1749817882\" width=600 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3589430/extras/3fe73b3c07298706e63509d130bddead.webm?t=1749817882\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3589430/extras/3fe73b3c07298706e63509d130bddead.mp4?t=1749817882\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Guide your goats through blooming meadows, help them find the best flowers to graze, and keep them happy with toys and attention. In return, they'll provide milk and wool, which are precious resources for the village's revival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3589430/extras/c0ebf2b0eb40fceeede644244d03cd0c.webp?t=1749817882\" width=350 height=30 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3589430/extras/8e19e36b1d1d0ff7409f5c099e26f3b4.poster.avif?t=1749817882\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3589430/extras/8e19e36b1d1d0ff7409f5c099e26f3b4.webm?t=1749817882\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3589430/extras/8e19e36b1d1d0ff7409f5c099e26f3b4.mp4?t=1749817882\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use what nature provides to create artisanal products like cheese, wool clothing, herbal remedies, and wooden crafts. Trade or share these with villagers to help improve their homes and livelihoods. Every choice helps shape your relationship with the community.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3589430/extras/2448db867dbc2e4a0f05d3fb9fa14c48.webp?t=1749817882\" width=350 height=30 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3589430/extras/148ab698b866eef222ad8e739cad1c1b.poster.avif?t=1749817882\" width=600 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3589430/extras/148ab698b866eef222ad8e739cad1c1b.webm?t=1749817882\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3589430/extras/148ab698b866eef222ad8e739cad1c1b.mp4?t=1749817882\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wander across lush valleys, quiet forests, and high-altitude lakes. Herd goats, forage for herbs and mushrooms, and fish in peaceful alpine waters. As you aid the village, you'll unlock new abilities that make it easier to climb, leap, and uncover parts of your newfound world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3589430/extras/648e1c3c26938eb5bde0a7e34480c4c6.webp?t=1749817882\" width=350 height=30 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3589430/extras/187369e099987014a2cae5bcbfd1d74c.poster.avif?t=1749817882\" width=600 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3589430/extras/187369e099987014a2cae5bcbfd1d74c.webm?t=1749817882\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3589430/extras/187369e099987014a2cae5bcbfd1d74c.mp4?t=1749817882\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Through branching dialogue and personal choices, you'll support villagers in rebuilding not just their homes but their lives. Will you embrace slow living or push for bolder change? Stay cozy within the village or open up to what lies beyond?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by the spirit of the<i> Heidi </i>novels, the narrative explores themes of healing through nature, the importance of helping one another, and the different ways to rebuild a community.</p>",
    "short_description": "Heidi's Legacy is a cozy narrative sim where you care for goats, craft mountain goods, and help villagers rebuild their lives. Experience a peaceful pastoral life, inspired by the Heidi novels, celebrating nature, healing, community, and self-discovery.",
